---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Plugins">
  <h1>🔌 Plugins 目录</h1>
  <p class="subtitle">OpenClaw 插件扩展，增强 Agent 能力</p>

  <section class="coming-soon">
    <div class="coming-content">
      <span class="coming-icon">🚧</span>
      <h2>Plugins 即将上线</h2>
      <p>我们正在准备 Plugins 系统，敬请期待！</p>
      <p class="coming-desc">
        Plugins 将允许你扩展 OpenClaw 的核心功能，集成更多第三方服务。
      </p>
      <div class="expected-features">
        <h3>计划功能</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>✨ 自定义工具集成</li>
          <li>🔌 第三方 API 连接器</li>
          <li>🤖 多模型 Provider 扩展</li>
          <li>📡 自定义消息通道</li>
          <li>🔐 安全认证扩展</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <a href="https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/discussions" target="_blank" class="notify-btn">
        关注进展 →
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="difference">
    <h2>🤔 Skills vs Plugins</h2>
    <div class="compare-grid">
      <div class="compare-card">
        <h3>🔧 Skills</h3>
        <p class="compare-desc">Agent 技能包</p>
        <ul>
          <li>定义 Agent 的行为和能力</li>
          <li>提供工具函数和 Prompt</li>
          <li>通过 SKILL.md 配置</li>
          <li>可从 ClawHub 安装</li>
          <li>适合：搜索、邮件、天气等任务</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="/skills" class="compare-link">浏览 Skills →</a>
      </div>
      <div class="compare-card">
        <h3>🔌 Plugins</h3>
        <p class="compare-desc">系统扩展插件</p>
        <ul>
          <li>扩展 OpenClaw 核心功能</li>
          <li>添加新的 Channel/Provider</li>
          <li>修改系统行为</li>
          <li>需要开发者权限</li>
          <li>适合：集成新平台、底层扩展</li>
        </ul>
        <span class="compare-link disabled">即将上线</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .subtitle {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .coming-soon {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 3rem;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .coming-icon {
    font-size: 4rem;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .coming-content h2 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .coming-content p {
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .coming-desc {
    max-width: 500px;
    margin: 1rem auto 2rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .expected-features {
    background: var(--bg);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    text-align: left;
    max-width: 400px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .expected-features h3 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .expected-features ul {
    list-style: none;
  }

  .expected-features li {
    padding: 0.5rem 0;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .notify-btn {
    display: inline-block;
    background: var(--primary);
    color: white;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 500;
    transition: background 0.2s;
  }

  .notify-btn:hover {
    background: var(--primary-dark);
  }

  .difference h2 {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .compare-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .compare-card {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 1.5rem;
  }

  .compare-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .compare-desc {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .compare-card ul {
    list-style: none;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .compare-card li {
    padding: 0.4rem 0;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
  }

  .compare-card li::before {
    content: '•';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .compare-link {
    display: inline-block;
    color: var(--accent);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .compare-link:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .compare-link.disabled {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    cursor: not-allowed;
  }

  .compare-link.disabled:hover {
    text-decoration: none;
  }
</style>
